seek-harness`, `dsh`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Full guide: Use with DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Install and open **Jiey Browser** so its MCP server is up (default `http://127.0.0.1:9100`).\n- **"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"Download only from the official site:** https://www.gongxingglobal.com/browser\n(macOS / Windows / Li"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"nux installers are listed there — this repo does not ship CDN links.)\n2. Discovery order: plugin `se"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"rverUrl` → `BROWSEROS_URL` / `JIEY_URL` → `~/.browseros/server.json` → `http://127.0.0.1:9100`.\n3. H"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ealth check: `GET /system/health` must return `{ status: \"ok\" }`."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"If Jiey is offline, tools fail with a link to the official download page (default `https://www.gongx"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ingglobal.com/browser`) instead of silently falling back to another browser."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"In the profile `cordis.patch.yml` (or DSH settings UI):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Security:** `allowCookies` defaults to **false**. Turn it on only when the user explicitly wants t"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"he agent to use existing logged-in sites."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Tool | Maps to Jiey MCP | Role |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `browser_open` | `tabs` new + `snapshot` | Open |\n| `browser_navigate` | `navigate` | Navigate |\n|"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" `browser_snapshot` | `snapshot` | Refs for act |\n| `browser_read` | `read` | Markdown / text scrape"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" |\n| `browser_act` | `act` | click / fill / press / … |\n| `browser_screenshot` | `screenshot` | Inli"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ne image (no temp file) |\n| `browser_tabs` | `tabs` list/close | List / dispose |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Local smoke (no DSH)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"With Jiey running, smoke opens `https://example.com`, snapshots, and closes the tab."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
